cite_internationale_des_arts_faaa6d16811c,cite_internationale_des_arts,https://www.hkst.de/en/scholarships_/applications-2/,https://bewerberportal.hkst.de/teamworks.dll?ShowSysMessages=true&urlencUTF8=true,Hessische Kulturstiftung,The application portal for the Hessische Kulturstiftung 2027/2028 travel and residency grants is open through 15 October 2026 .,Visual artists,travel and residency grants,Germany,,"2027/2028: 5 travel grants (à 25.000 Euro) 2027: 1 residency in New York City (à 25,000 euros) 1 residency in Paris (à 25,000 euros) 2 residencies in Istanbul (à 12,500 euros) 1 residency in Kyoto with subsequent travel and work phase in Japan (à 15,000 euros) 2028: 1 residency in New York City (à 25,000 euros) 1 residency in Paris (à 25,000 euros) 1 residency in London (à 25.000 Euro) 1 residency in Kyoto with subsequent travel and work phase in Japan (à 15,000 euros) For the production of works that evolve within the framework of the grant or for their presentation in exhibitions or publications, the foundation will provide additional funding of up to 7,700 euros. The grant recipient can make use of this allowance for up to three years after the end of the grant period.",,,The application portal for the Hessische Kulturstiftung 2027/2028 travel and residency grants is open through 15 October 2026 .,Visual artists,travel and residency grants,,Germany,,['Visual Arts'],"['Grant/Funding', 'Residency']",[],['Germany'],"[{'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': 25000.0, 'amount_max': 25000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'travel grant'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 25000.0, 'amount_max': 25000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'residency in New York City'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 25000.0, 'amount_max': 25000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'residency in Paris'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 12500.0, 'amount_max': 12500.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'residencies in Istanbul'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 15000.0, 'amount_max': 15000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'residency in Kyoto with subsequent travel and work phase in Japan'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': 7700.0, 'amount_max': 7700.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': None, 'note': 'additional funding for production/presentation, available up to three years after grant period'}]",2026-09-24 08:56:51.875107+00:00,,,,,en,Hessische Kulturstiftung 2027/2028 travel and residency grants,"Visual artists who … were born in Hesse or have lived in Hesse (primary residence) since no later than 1 January 2025 or have completed a degree at an art academy or a comparable course of study/training in Hesse can apply. There is no age limit. Artist duos may submit a joint application. Applications are not accepted from persons who … have been awarded a Hessische Kulturstiftung travel or residency grant in the past (does not apply to State of Hesse work, project, or gap grants) are still in the process of pursuing a degree vocational training programme at the time of the application are related to one of the jury members, are employed by the Hessische Kulturstiftung, or are related to a Hessische Kulturstiftung employee.",Hessische Kulturstiftung 2027/2028 travel and residency grants,"Visual artists who … were born in Hesse or have lived in Hesse (primary residence) since no later than 1 January 2025 or have completed a degree at an art academy or a comparable course of study/training in Hesse can apply. There is no age limit. Artist duos may submit a joint application. Applications are not accepted from persons who … have been awarded a Hessische Kulturstiftung travel or residency grant in the past (does not apply to State of Hesse work, project, or gap grants) are still in the process of pursuing a degree vocational training programme at the time of the application are related to one of the jury members, are employed by the Hessische Kulturstiftung, or are related to a Hessische Kulturstiftung employee.",15 October 2026,2026-10-15,2026-09-23 12:36:52.773274+00:00
cite_internationale_des_arts_f26918d6e623,cite_internationale_des_arts,https://www.cnc.fr/professionnels/aides-et-financements/multi-sectoriel/ecriture-et-developpement/camera-libre_1812991,,CNC en partenariat avec la Cité internationale des arts et L’usage du monde au 21 e siècle,le programme de résidence « Caméra libre » consiste à accueillir en résidence en France des cinéastes étrangers en situation difficile.,Cinéma,programme de résidence,France,,,,,le programme de résidence « Caméra libre » consiste à accueillir en résidence en France des cinéastes étrangers en situation difficile.,Cinéma,programme de résidence,,France,,['Film/Video'],['Residency'],[],['France'],[],,,,,,en,Caméra libre,"Demandeur :
