ipatory practices, site-specific and community-based projects in urban space Conditions: shared accommodation and coworking space",15 Aug 2026,2026-08-15,2026-09-23 12:37:25.100239+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_022c12b266e3,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-carroussa-sonore/,http://forms.gle/Ndt74iNqRyiWJ1cN8,Kunsten,"ARTISTS ARE INVITED TO SUBMIT SOUND WORKS FOR THE OPPORTUNITY TO BE FEATURED IN A CURATED COLLECTIVE SOUND ART PERFORMANCE IN PUBLIC SPACE THROUGH THE SPEAKERS OF CARROUSSA SONORE, A PROJECT BY ARTIST YOUNES BABA-ALI.",sound art,open call,Belgium,Antwerp,A PARTICIPATION HONORARIUM OF €185 (EX.VAT) IS PROVIDED PER PARTICIPATING ARTIST AS PART OF THIS PROJECT.,,,"ARTISTS ARE INVITED TO SUBMIT SOUND WORKS FOR THE OPPORTUNITY TO BE FEATURED IN A CURATED COLLECTIVE SOUND ART PERFORMANCE IN PUBLIC SPACE THROUGH THE SPEAKERS OF CARROUSSA SONORE, A PROJECT BY ARTIST YOUNES BABA-ALI.",sound art,open call,,Belgium,Antwerp,['Music'],['Open Call'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 185.0, 'amount_max': 185.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': None, 'note': 'participation honorarium ex. VAT per participating artist'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169387+00:00,,,,,en,OPEN CALL CARROUSSA SONORE,"THIS CALL FOR PARTICIPATION IS OPEN TO ANY ARTIST, ASSOCIATION, OR COLLECTIVE OF INTERNATIONAL ARTISTS WITHOUT AGE LIMIT. A PARTICIPATION HONORARIUM OF €185 (EX.VAT) IS PROVIDED PER PARTICIPATING ARTIST AS PART OF THIS PROJECT. CANDIDATES CAN APPLY BY FILLING IN THIS GOOGLE FORM . IMPORTANT NOTE: IN ORDER TO BEABLE TO MAKE THE PAYMENT OF THE FEE WHEN SELECTED, ARTISTS MUSTBEABLE TO INVOICE (EITHER THROUGH THEIR OWN STRUCTURE ORATHIRD PARTY).",OPEN CALL CARROUSSA SONORE,"THIS CALL FOR PARTICIPATION IS OPEN TO ANY ARTIST, ASSOCIATION, OR COLLECTIVE OF INTERNATIONAL ARTISTS WITHOUT AGE LIMIT. A PARTICIPATION HONORARIUM OF €185 (EX.VAT) IS PROVIDED PER PARTICIPATING ARTIST AS PART OF THIS PROJECT. CANDIDATES CAN APPLY BY FILLING IN THIS GOOGLE FORM . IMPORTANT NOTE: IN ORDER TO BEABLE TO MAKE THE PAYMENT OF THE FEE WHEN SELECTED, ARTISTS MUSTBEABLE TO INVOICE (EITHER THROUGH THEIR OWN STRUCTURE ORATHIRD PARTY).",15 Aug 2026,2026-08-15,2026-09-23 12:37:25.103163+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_c491dbaacb88,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-2026-finno-ugric-creative-residency-in-narva/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScQMVMcM-I2XeQitlnQq3frY4MTg8ceVSAeREZ1rIu8Qf_0DA/viewform,Narva Art Residency,"Narva Art Residency announces an open call for a Finno-Ugric creative residency, which will take place in late 2026.","visual art, music, theatre, and performance",Residency,Estonia,Narva,"We offer the artist an Erasmus+ per diem allowance, which is 170€ per day (1700€ for the period of the residency, 10 days). The accommodation is provided at NART building for the rate of 45€ per day (450€ for the period of the residency). The Erasmus+ support also covers any costs that go towards the production of the artwork. The reimbursement of the travel costs is provided separately and in addition to the per diems, following the guidelines of the Erasmus+ programme.",,,"Narva Art Residency announces an open call for a Finno-Ugric creative residency, which will take place in late 2026.","visual art, music, theatre, and performance",Residency,,Estonia,Narva,"['Visual Arts', 'Music', 'Theatre', 'Performing Arts']",['Residency'],[],['Estonia'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 170.0, 'amount_max': 170.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'Erasmus+ per diem allowance'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': 45.0, 'amount_max': 45.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'accommodation at NART building'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'production costs covered by Erasmus+ support'}, {'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'reimbursed separately according to Erasmus+ guidelines'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169404+00:00,,,,,en,2026 FINNO-UGRIC CREATIVE RESIDENCY IN NARVA,"We are looking for applications from artists and creative people with roots from or strong ties to the Finno-Ugric peoples. The call is open to various creative fields, including visual art, music, theatre, and performance. The residency comes with support from the Erasmus+ programme and is therefore directed to applicants from eligible countries (see the list here ). In 2026, the second edition of the programme will include new features. As before, the selected artist is expected to create a work inspired by Finno-Ugric cultures. Additionally, they will collaborate closely with the Department of Fashion Design of the Estonian Academy of Arts. The collaboration will consist of an open lecture for the academy’s students (1,5h) and two workshops for the fashion design students (5h and 1,5h). From the artist-in-residence we expect a unique contemporary art project that introduces Finno-Ugric culture in a new and engaging form; a willingness to involve the local Narva community and introduce and present their work; engage with the students of EKA and give them a workshop and an open lecture which are connected to the topics of Finno-Ugric cultures, as well as participation in the residency during the period from November 23rd until December 6th. The application should be filled out in English.",2026 FINNO-UGRIC CREATIVE RESIDENCY IN NARVA,"We are looking for applications from artists and creative people with roots from or strong ties to the Finno-Ugric peoples. The call is open to various creative fields, including visual art, music, theatre, and performance. The residency comes with support from the Erasmus+ programme and is therefore directed to applicants from eligible countries (see the list here ). In 2026, the second edition of the programme will include new features. As before, the selected artist is expected to create a work inspired by Finno-Ugric cultures. Additionally, they will collaborate closely with the Department of Fashion Design of the Estonian Academy of Arts. The collaboration will consist of an open lecture for the academy’s students (1,5h) and two workshops for the fashion design students (5h and 1,5h). From the artist-in-residence we expect a unique contemporary art project that introduces Finno-Ugric culture in a new and engaging form; a willingness to involve the local Narva community and introduce and present their work; engage with the students of EKA and give them a workshop and an open lecture which are connected to the topics of Finno-Ugric cultures, as well as participation in the residency during the period from November 23rd until December 6th. The application should be filled out in English.",10 Aug 2026,2026-08-10,2026-09-23 12:37:25.106105+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_98e9614f22f8,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-submission-finno-ugric-creative-residency-in-narva-estonia/,https://www.nart.ee/en/open-call-2026-finno-ugric-creative-residency-in-narva/,Narva Art Residency,"Narva Art Residency announces an open call for a Finno-Ugric creative residency, which will take place in late 2026.","visual art, music, theatre, and performance",residency,Estonia,Narva,"We offer the artist an Erasmus+ per diem allowance, which is 170€ per day (1700€ for the period of the residency, 10 days). This is to cover the accommodation at NART, daily costs and other costs related to the residency. The accommodation is provided at NART building for the rate of 45€ per day (450€ for the period of the residency). The Erasmus+ support also covers any costs that go towards the production of the artwork. The reimbursement of the travel costs is provided separately and in addition to the per diems, following the guidelines of the Erasmus+ programme. The amount depends on the distance between the place of domicile and Narva, Estonia.",,,"Narva Art Residency announces an open call for a Finno-Ugric creative residency, which will take place in late 2026.","visual art, music, theatre, and performance",residency,,Estonia,Narva,"['Visual Arts', 'Music', 'Theatre', 'Performing Arts']",['Residency'],[],['Estonia'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 170.0, 'amount_max': 170.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'Erasmus+ per diem allowance'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': 45.0, 'amount_max': 45.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'accommodation at NART building'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'production costs covered by Erasmus+ support'}, {'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'travel reimbursement depends on distance and available budget'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169495+00:00,,,,,en,Open Call Submission: Finno-Ugric Creative Residency In Narva (Estonia),"We are looking for applications from artists and creative people with roots from or strong ties to the Finno-Ugric peoples. The call is open to various creative fields, including visual art, music, theatre, and performance. The residency comes with support from the Erasmus+ programme and is therefore directed to applicants from eligible countries (see the list here ). In 2026, the second edition of the programme will include new features. As before, the selected artist is expected to create a work inspired by Finno-Ugric cultures. Additionally, they will collaborate closely with the Department of Fashion Design of the Estonian Academy of Arts. The collaboration will consist of an open lecture for the academy’s students (1,5h) and two workshops for the fashion design students (5h and 1,5h). From the artist-in-residence we expect a unique contemporary art project that introduces Finno-Ugric culture in a new and engaging form; a willingness to involve the local Narva community and introduce and present their work; engage with the students of EKA and give them a workshop and an open lecture which are connected to the topics of Finno-Ugric cultures, as well as participation in the residency during the period from November 23rd until December 6th.",Open Call Submission: Finno-Ugric Creative Residency In Narva (Estonia),"We are looking for applications from artists and creative people with roots from or strong ties to the Finno-Ugric peoples. The call is open to various creative fields, including visual art, music, theatre, and performance. The residency comes with support from the Erasmus+ programme and is therefore directed to applicants from eligible countries (see the list here ). In 2026, the second edition of the programme will include new features. As before, the selected artist is expected to create a work inspired by Finno-Ugric cultures. Additionally, they will collaborate closely with the Department of Fashion Design of the Estonian Academy of Arts. The collaboration will consist of an open lecture for the academy’s students (1,5h) and two workshops for the fashion design students (5h and 1,5h). From the artist-in-residence we expect a unique contemporary art project that introduces Finno-Ugric culture in a new and engaging form; a willingness to involve the local Narva community and introduce and present their work; engage with the students of EKA and give them a workshop and an open lecture which are connected to the topics of Finno-Ugric cultures, as well as participation in the residency during the period from November 23rd until December 6th.",10 Aug 2026,2026-08-10,2026-09-23 12:37:25.109141+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_77d04eb32770,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-broedfestival-2027/,https://broedfestival.be/3/,Festival Stout vzw,"Have you been working on something for a while and would like to showcase your work at BROEDfestival? Great! Use this form to register for the 2027 Open Call, which gives you the opportunity to participate in BROEDfestival on February 22 and/or 23. BROEDfestival offers performing artists the chance to perform on one of our two festival days. Visual artists and multimedia creators can exhibit their work continuously in the hallways and spaces of c o r s o. If you showcase your work at BROED, you’ll be compensated for it and can access limited funding to further develop your work.",performing artists; visual artists; multimedia creators,open call; festival,,,you’ll be compensated for it and can access limited funding to further develop your work,,artists who haven’t yet had the chance to fully break into the professional sector,"Have you been working on something for a while and would like to showcase your work at BROEDfestival? Great! Use this form to register for the 2027 Open Call, which gives you the opportunity to participate in BROEDfestival on February 22 and/or 23. BROEDfestival offers performing artists the chance to perform on one of our two festival days. Visual artists and multimedia creators can exhibit their work continuously in the hallways and spaces of c o r s o. If you showcase your work at BROED, you’ll be compensated for it and can access limited funding to further develop your work.",performing artists; visual artists; multimedia creators,open call; festival,artists who haven’t yet had the chance to fully break into the professional sector,,,"['Performing Arts', 'Visual Arts', 'Digital/New Media Arts']","['Open Call', 'Other']",['Emerging/Early-Career'],[],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'compensation provided'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'limited funding to further develop work'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169597+00:00,,,,,en,Open Call BROEDfestival 2027,"Because BROEDfestival aims primarily to support artists who haven’t yet had the chance to fully break into the professional sector, you and your project must meet the following requirements to submit an application: You are over 18 years of age. You have not received any major or structured grants or scholarships for the project you wish to submit. You do not yet have a (co-)producer for your project, nor an organization under whose wing you can create. Your artistic career is still in its relative infancy.",Open Call BROEDfestival 2027,"Because BROEDfestival aims primarily to support artists who haven’t yet had the chance to fully break into the professional sector, you and your project must meet the following requirements to submit an application: You are over 18 years of age. You have not received any major or structured grants or scholarships for the project you wish to submit. You do not yet have a (co-)producer for your project, nor an organization under whose wing you can create. Your artistic career is still in its relative infancy.",01 Aug 2026,2026-08-01,2026-09-23 12:37:25.112199+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_5a5e4ce2e090,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/gezocht-opkomende-kunstenaars-die-op-zoek-zijn-naar-begeleiding/,https://framaforms.org/pairing-is-caring-2026-application-1781945486,"Kunstenpunt, The Gap, NICC","It can be particularly difficult for emerging artists to find their way in the professional field. Through Pairing is Caring , we pair an emerging artist with a more experienced artist or cultural professional (a ‘mentor’), so that knowledge about building an artistic career can be shared.","performing arts, performance art, visual arts, digital arts and multimedia",Call,Belgium,Brussels,,,emerging artists,"It can be particularly difficult for emerging artists to find their way in the professional field. Through Pairing is Caring , we pair an emerging artist with a more experienced artist or cultural professional (a ‘mentor’), so that knowledge about building an artistic career can be shared.","performing arts, performance art, visual arts, digital arts and multimedia",Call,emerging artists,Belgium,Brussels,"['Performing Arts', 'Theatre', 'Visual Arts', 'Digital/New Media Arts']",['Open Call'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Belgium'],[],,,,,,en,Wanted: Emerging artists looking for guidance in the arts field,"Artists We focus on the performing arts, performance art, the visual arts, digital arts and multimedia .",Wanted: Emerging artists looking for guidance in the arts field,"Artists We focus on the performing arts, performance art, the visual arts, digital arts and multimedia .",30 Jul 2026,2026-07-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.115828+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_217b1f327dad,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/ma-hoe-werkt-het-eigenlijk/,https://wp.assets.sh/uploads/sites/4718/2026/04/MAhoe_engels.pdf,MA Festival,During MA Festival 2026 you get the chance to talk to musicians and experts about what’s on your mind. You will also get a look behind the scenes by joining the volunteer crew for a few days.,performing music,Training,Belgium,Bruges,"Catering: we will provide meals for you from Tuesday 29/07 until Sunday evening 03/08. Accommodation: you will be accommodated free of charge in Bruges at boarding school Palaestra (check-in Monday 27/07 – check-out Monday 03/08). For the time you volunteer, you will receive an expense allowance of €11 per 4-hour shift You will receive a ticket for the opening concert of MA Festival on 01/08",,master’s degree or have just graduated,During MA Festival 2026 you get the chance to talk to musicians and experts about what’s on your mind. You will also get a look behind the scenes by joining the volunteer crew for a few days.,performing music,Training,master’s degree or have just graduated,Belgium,Bruges,['Music'],['Workshop/Training'],"['Student', 'Emerging/Early-Career']",['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'free accommodation'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'meals provided'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 11.0, 'amount_max': 11.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'expense allowance per 4-hour shift'}, {'category': 'Exhibition/Presentation Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'ticket for the opening concert'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169606+00:00,,,,,en,MA hoe werkt het eigenlijk? (‘But how does it work?’),"You are a performing musician
