kunsten_be_flanders_b75775a347f7,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-for-artists-art-educators/,https://reon-space.com/air,REON,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. An independent small scale program, and taking place in the mountainous village of Porta on the island of Corfu, it offers an open-ended environment for work, research and play.",clay & ceramics,Residency,Corfu island,Porta,"Provided by REON: Accommodation, access to a fully equipped ceramics studio, basic materials, facilitation and collaborative support, transportation ** Covered by the artist Vehicle rental (essential), food & personal expenses, extended material costs (excluding materials used in community projects, a voluntary contribution for utility costs, transportation ** Transportation ** Transportation costs for the Artist Educator Residency or a Combined Residency are fully covered. For the Artist Residency, there is a possibility that transportation expenses may also be covered fully or partially, depending on the available budget and whether the proposed project includes elements of engagement with local children.",15 Euro (to be payed via bank transfer),"Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification.","REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. An independent small scale program, and taking place in the mountainous village of Porta on the island of Corfu, it offers an open-ended environment for work, research and play.",clay & ceramics,Residency,"Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification.",Corfu island,Porta,['Craft'],['Residency'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Greece'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'accommodation provided by REON'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'access to fully equipped ceramics studio and basic materials; collaborative support/facilitation'}, {'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'transportation covered for Artist Educator Residency or Combined Residency; for Artist Residency may be fully or partially covered depending on budget'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'vehicle rental essential, food & personal expenses, extended material costs, voluntary contribution for utility costs to be covered by the artist'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169689+00:00,True,15.0,15.0,EUR,en,Open call for artists & art educators,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. REON is keen to welcome professionals such as artists, researchers, designers, architects and other practitioners working across diverse approaches to clay. Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification. While the program centers on clay, we also consider proposals that do not directly engage with the material, but respond thoughtfully to the islandic context.",Open call for artists & art educators,"REON is excited to announce that it is now accepting applications from international art practitioners & educators, working across diverse approaches to clay & ceramics, for its upcoming residency in September-October 2026 in Corfu island. REON is keen to welcome professionals such as artists, researchers, designers, architects and other practitioners working across diverse approaches to clay. Recent graduates are welcome to apply, as well as individuals who have gotten through a gap in their career, without need for further justification. While the program centers on clay, we also consider proposals that do not directly engage with the material, but respond thoughtfully to the islandic context.",05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.121448+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_b9f09f8cf7be,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-architect-in-residence-galicia-spain/,https://ocastroartvillage.com/open-call-architect-residency-o-castro-art-village/,O Castro Art Village,"We are inviting one architect to spend 30 days here during October 2026; not to rebuild, but to look, to measure, and to develop a site-specific spatial intervention study rooted in this place: its vernacular stone construction, its forest, its particular relationship between what was built and what grows.",architecture,Residency,Spain,Galicia,"Travel allowance €400 (€800 over 5,000 km) Daily allowance €30/day Accommodation on site Mentorship",,,"We are inviting one architect to spend 30 days here during October 2026; not to rebuild, but to look, to measure, and to develop a site-specific spatial intervention study rooted in this place: its vernacular stone construction, its forest, its particular relationship between what was built and what grows.",architecture,Residency,,Spain,Galicia,['Design/Architecture'],['Residency'],[],['Spain'],"[{'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': 400.0, 'amount_max': 800.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': '€800 over 5,000 km'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 30.0, 'amount_max': 30.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'daily allowance'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'accommodation on site'}, {'category': 'Mentorship/Training', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'mentorship'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169698+00:00,,,,,en,"Open Call: Architect in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,"Open Call: Architect in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026