kunsten_be_flanders_9b98d1b06cf2,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-visual-mixed-media-artist-in-residence-galicia-spain/,https://ocastroartvillage.com/open-call-visual-artist-residency-o-castro-art-village/,O Castro Art Village,"We are inviting one visual or mixed-media artist, with a particular interest in video or expanded image practices to spend 30 days here during October 2026 and develop a permanent installation integrated into the ruins or the landscape.",Visual / Mixed-Media,Residency,Spain,Galicia,"Travel allowance €400 (€800 over 5,000 km) Daily allowance €30/day Accommodation on site Mentorship",,,"We are inviting one visual or mixed-media artist, with a particular interest in video or expanded image practices to spend 30 days here during October 2026 and develop a permanent installation integrated into the ruins or the landscape.",Visual / Mixed-Media,Residency,,Spain,Galicia,['Visual Arts'],['Residency'],[],['Spain'],"[{'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': 400.0, 'amount_max': 800.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': '€800 over 5,000 km'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 30.0, 'amount_max': 30.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per day', 'note': 'daily allowance'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'accommodation on site'}, {'category': 'Mentorship/Training', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'mentorship'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169809+00:00,,,,,en,"Open Call: Visual / Mixed-Media Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,"Open Call: Visual / Mixed-Media Artist in Residence Galicia, Spain",Legal resident of a European country other than Spain. Full 30-day availability required.,05 Jul 2026,2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.131072+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_696dbc1b4c63,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-temporary-centre-for-shared-practice/,,Kunsthal Gent,"Are you a Ghent-based visu­al artist under 30 , loo­king for a tem­po­ra­ry workspa­ce, a pla­ce for try-outs, and a col­lec­ti­ve wor­king atmos­p­he­re? From Sep­tem­ber until the end of Decem­ber 2026 , Kunst­hal Gent will trans­form into a sha­red workspace. We invi­te young artists to research, expe­ri­ment, get to know one ano­ther, and col­la­bo­ra­te.",visual arts,open call,Belgium,Ghent,"We offer a sha­red struc­tu­re, time, com­pa­ny, and support.",,young artists,"Are you a Ghent-based visu­al artist under 30 , loo­king for a tem­po­ra­ry workspa­ce, a pla­ce for try-outs, and a col­lec­ti­ve wor­king atmos­p­he­re? From Sep­tem­ber until the end of Decem­ber 2026 , Kunst­hal Gent will trans­form into a sha­red workspace. We invi­te young artists to research, expe­ri­ment, get to know one ano­ther, and col­la­bo­ra­te.",visual arts,open call,young artists,Belgium,Ghent,['Visual Arts'],['Open Call'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'shared structure, time, company, and support'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169861+00:00,,,,,en,Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or youn­ger . You hold a degree in hig­her arts edu­ca­ti­on (visu­al arts) . Any­o­ne gra­du­a­ting by Sep­tem­ber 2026 is wel­come to apply. You have a con­nec­ti­on to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gal­le­rist here, or recent­ly gra­du­a­ted from a Ghent art academy. You recog­ni­ze the value of a sup­por­ti­ve art field and the power of collaboration.",Temporary centre for shared practice,"You are 30 years old or youn­ger . You hold a degree in hig­her arts edu­ca­ti­on (visu­al arts) . Any­o­ne gra­du­a­ting by Sep­tem­ber 2026 is wel­come to apply. You have a con­nec­ti­on to Ghent : you live in Ghent, have a studio or a gal­le­rist here, or recent­ly gra­du­a­ted from a Ghent art academy. You recog­ni­ze the value of a sup­por­ti­ve art field and the power of collaboration.","Sunday, July 5, 2026, 23:59",2026-07-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.135343+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_f3813b0a41ba,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/prima-la-musica-zoekt-jong-talent-vijfde-editie-jubileum/,https://www.primalamusica.be/young-talent,Prima La Musica,"Prima La Musica, the chamber orchestra led by composer/conductor Dirk Brossé, is once again offering young musicians who aspire a professional career, six months of intensive coaching. This career boosting opportunity (fifth edition!) will unfold in various phases: one-on-one workshops, covering different aspects of the profession; artistic coaching; and a closing concert at Muziekcentrum De Bijloke (Ghent) on December 9th, 2026. At this closing concert, the selected soloist will perform a work of his or her choosing together with Prima La Musica and the selected conductor will conduct one of the works selected for the concert programme. A unique opportunity for ambitious young musicians.",young musicians,call,Belgium,Ghent,six months of intensive coaching,,young musicians,"Prima La Musica, the chamber orchestra led by composer/conductor Dirk Brossé, is once again offering young musicians who aspire a professional career, six months of intensive coaching. This career boosting opportunity (fifth edition!) will unfold in various phases: one-on-one workshops, covering different aspects of the profession; artistic coaching; and a closing concert at Muziekcentrum De Bijloke (Ghent) on December 9th, 2026. At this closing concert, the selected soloist will perform a work of his or her choosing together with Prima La Musica and the selected conductor will conduct one of the works selected for the concert programme. A unique opportunity for ambitious young musicians.",young musicians,call,young musicians,Belgium,Ghent,['Music'],['Open Call'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Mentorship/Training', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'six months of intensive coaching'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754513+00:00,,,,,en,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,Prima La Musica seeks young talent (fifth edition),young musicians who aspire a professional career,01 Jul 2026,2026-07-01,2026-09-23 12:37:25.149449+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_15a23e278f66,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-full-spectrum-curatorship-programme-2026/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd9E3PEevHy8rzvKY0g84qYX2-YZcWXLar8lZwDW_7_WxIghg/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=108158982485858052890,IMPAKT [Centre for Media Culture],"IMPAKT [Centre for Media Culture] invites emerging and aspiring curators with an interest in media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society to apply for the Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme.","media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society",Training,Netherlands,Utrecht,"During the final phase of the programme, participants will receive an €800 stipend to support the preparation of their final project proposal.",The fee for participation is €400.,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators","IMPAKT [Centre for Media Culture] invites emerging and aspiring curators with an interest in media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society to apply for the Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme.","media art, digital culture, and the intersection of technology and society",Training,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators",Netherlands,Utrecht,"['Digital/New Media Arts', 'Multidisciplinary']",['Workshop/Training'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Netherlands'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 800.0, 'amount_max': 800.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'stipend for preparation of final project proposal'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:10.169868+00:00,True,400.0,400.0,EUR,en,Open Call Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme 2026,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators, are invited to apply. Participants are expected to attend all sessions, including those in which fellow participants present and discuss their projects. Alongside the collective sessions, participants will take part in mentor sessions, either individually or in duos. The programme requires a minimum commitment of 8 hours per week, including preparation, research, and independent work. Please note that all sessions will be held in English.",Open Call Full Spectrum Curatorship Programme 2026,"Recent graduates, as well as aspiring and emerging curators, are invited to apply. Participants are expected to attend all sessions, including those in which fellow participants present and discuss their projects. Alongside the collective sessions, participants will take part in mentor sessions, either individually or in duos. The programme requires a minimum commitment of 8 hours per week, including preparation, research, and independent work. Please note that all sessions will be held in English.","23:59 (CET), 1 July 2026",2026-09-24,2026-09-23 12:37:25.146446+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_3792b5c76856,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/summer-2026-international-open-call-for-visual-artists-in-andalusia-spain/,https://rec-on.es/artist-residency/,REC.ON,This call is for a paid residency.,visual artists,Residency,Spain,Almeria,This call is for a paid residency.,,,This call is for a paid residency.,visual artists,Residency,,Spain,Almeria,['Visual Arts'],['Residency'],[],['Spain'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'paid residency; amount not stated'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754530+00:00,,,,,en,Summer 2026 International Open Call for Visual Artists in Andalusia (Spain),Audience: professional visual artists internationally,Summer 2026 International Open Call for Visual Artists in Andalusia (Spain),Audience: professional visual artists internationally,30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.152375+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_dc652541cc80,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kunstenpunt-zoekt-beelden-uit-het-kunstenveld/,,Flanders Arts Institute,Flanders Arts Institute is launching a call for relevant and representative images of the arts sector . These images should reflect the current cultural landscape whilst also giving visibility to diverse stakeholders within the sector.,Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts,call,,,you will receive a one-off payment of €50 if we use one of your images,,,Flanders Arts Institute is launching a call for relevant and representative images of the arts sector . These images should reflect the current cultural landscape whilst also giving visibility to diverse stakeholders within the sector.,Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts,call,,,,"['Visual Arts', 'Music', 'Performing Arts']",['Open Call'],[],[],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 50.0, 'amount_max': 50.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'one-off payment if one of your images is used'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754536+00:00,,,,,en,Flanders Arts Institute is looking for images of the arts sector,Anyone who feels called upon to contribute to representative visual communication is welcome to take part: from amateur photographers to professionals or arts organisations. We ask that you submit a maximum of three images related to one of our disciplines: Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts,Flanders Arts Institute is looking for images of the arts sector,Anyone who feels called upon to contribute to representative visual communication is welcome to take part: from amateur photographers to professionals or arts organisations. We ask that you submit a maximum of three images related to one of our disciplines: Visual Arts Classical music Performing Arts,30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.155547+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_a8b33f98769e,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/contrapuncta-composition-contest-2026-edition/,https://www.helloasso.com/associations/association-contrapuncta/evenements/concours-de-composition,Association Contrapuncta,"In order to promote the musical creation of today, the association Contrapuncta launches a call for compositions for solo piano.",music,composition contest,,,The rewards are as follows : – The Jury prize: 1000€ – The Public prize: 500€,€35,,"In order to promote the musical creation of today, the association Contrapuncta launches a call for compositions for solo piano.",music,composition contest,,,,['Music'],['Competition/Prize'],[],[],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1000.0, 'amount_max': 1000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'Jury prize'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 500.0, 'amount_max': 500.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'Public prize'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754590+00:00,True,35.0,35.0,EUR,en,Contrapuncta composition contest – 2026 Edition,"The contest is open to all persons, without restriction of nationality or age. The musical scores are anonymous so that only the works are judged. It is possible to present several works. The proposed work must be original, written for solo piano (2 hands), with a duration between 6 minutes and 12 minutes and not have been commercially exploited.",Contrapuncta composition contest – 2026 Edition,"The contest is open to all persons, without restriction of nationality or age. The musical scores are anonymous so that only the works are judged. It is possible to present several works. The proposed work must be original, written for solo piano (2 hands), with a duration between 6 minutes and 12 minutes and not have been commercially exploited.",30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.158561+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_5dcf621a062f,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/soundpainting-academy/,https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfWGqo-EjWJKCndCTLq7KUy1iJenkCcJboj_pCl4MYvnk8lxA/viewform,"MATRIX centrum voor nieuwe muziek, Muziekcentrum De Bijloke",Soundpainting is een multidisciplinaire gebarentaal waarbij live gecreëerd wordt.,music,Training,Belgium,Gent,,€200,,Soundpainting is een multidisciplinaire gebarentaal waarbij live gecreëerd wordt.,music,Training,,Belgium,Gent,['Music'],['Workshop/Training'],[],['Belgium'],[],,True,200.0,200.0,EUR,en,Soundpainting Academy,"Leerkrachten uit het DKO of (professionele) muzikanten die de taal van soundpainting willen toepassen in de eigen les- of artistieke praktijk. Tijdens de tweede editie van deze academy moedigen we, naast muzikanten, ook dansers en performers aan om deel te nemen.",Soundpainting Academy,"Leerkrachten uit het DKO of (professionele) muzikanten die de taal van soundpainting willen toepassen in de eigen les- of artistieke praktijk. Tijdens de tweede editie van deze academy moedigen we, naast muzikanten, ook dansers en performers aan om deel te nemen.",30 Jun 2026,2026-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.161506+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_7858eb98a09d,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/tussenruimte-zoekt-kunstenaars-voor-festival-de-kunst-van-rouw/,https://forms.gle/x2goSp6KNzq3RVms9,Tussenruimte,"Tussenruimte (Berchem) is looking for artists to take part in a co-creation and festival: De Kunst van Rouw (November 7–15 2026). Together with RetroRouw vzw, we are organising a multi-day arts festival around grief and loss. Through three collective meet-ups, we build towards a group exhibition together.","All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food.",festival,,Berchem,,,Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.,"Tussenruimte (Berchem) is looking for artists to take part in a co-creation and festival: De Kunst van Rouw (November 7–15 2026). Together with RetroRouw vzw, we are organising a multi-day arts festival around grief and loss. Through three collective meet-ups, we build towards a group exhibition together.","All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food.",festival,Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.,,Berchem,['Multidisciplinary'],['Other'],"['Emerging/Early-Career', 'Established/Professional']",[],[],,,,,,en,Tussenruimte is looking for artists,"All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food. Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.",Tussenruimte is looking for artists,"All artistic disciplines are welcome — visual art, performance, music, poetry, photography, and food. Both emerging and established artists are encouraged to apply.",30 June.,2027-06-30,2026-09-23 12:37:25.164319+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_32c6d7691640,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-what-the-drag-performers/,https://forms.gle/iY2WMSgNikUfNWTUA,Dwaalzin,"What the Drag?! is a volunteer-led project from Dwaalzin that creates a platform for emerging drag performers and queer voices. We aim to give beginning drag artists the space to experiment, perform, and connect with others, while introducing drag as an art form to a wider audience in an accessible and welcoming way.",drag,performance opportunity,Belgium,Brussels,Compensation: €100 for one act €130 for two acts,,emerging,"What the Drag?! is a volunteer-led project from Dwaalzin that creates a platform for emerging drag performers and queer voices. We aim to give beginning drag artists the space to experiment, perform, and connect with others, while introducing drag as an art form to a wider audience in an accessible and welcoming way.",drag,performance opportunity,emerging,Belgium,Brussels,['Other/Non-Arts'],['Other'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 100.0, 'amount_max': 100.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'for one act'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 130.0, 'amount_max': 130.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'for two acts'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754664+00:00,,,,,en,Open call – What the Drag?! performers,"We are looking for emerging drag performers (of all styles and backgrounds). You can apply with limited or growing experience, this platform is specifically intended as a space to experiment, try out ideas, and grow as an artist. We welcome applicants of all identities, bodies, and backgrounds. If you have specific needs or questions regarding accessibility, we are open to discussing this together.",Open call – What the Drag?! performers,"We are looking for emerging drag performers (of all styles and backgrounds). You can apply with limited or growing experience, this platform is specifically intended as a space to experiment, try out ideas, and grow as an artist. We welcome applicants of all identities, bodies, and backgrounds. If you have specific needs or questions regarding accessibility, we are open to discussing this together.",28 Jun 2026,2026-06-28,2026-09-23 12:37:25.167364+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_2dc1c2458880,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/residency-the-resonant-garden/,,Kasteel Wijlre estate,"Kasteel Wijlre estate invites international artists to apply for The Resonant Garden, a three-month residency set within the green surroundings of Kasteel Wijlre estate’s grounds and gardens.",artists,Residency,the Netherlands,Wijlre,"The residency includes a stipend of € 800,- per month for three months, and a production and research compensation of max. € 2,000,-.",,,"Kasteel Wijlre estate invites international artists to apply for The Resonant Garden, a three-month residency set within the green surroundings of Kasteel Wijlre estate’s grounds and gardens.",artists,Residency,,the Netherlands,Wijlre,['Multidisciplinary'],['Residency'],[],['Netherlands'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 800.0, 'amount_max': 800.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'stipend for three months'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': 2000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'production and research compensation'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754821+00:00,,,,,en,Residency – The Resonant Garden,"This call is open to artists living in the EU with both research- and studio-based practices who wish to engage with the garden as a metaphor, a method and/or a material environment. Applicants should embrace and value the rural location and the sense of quiet and relative isolation that living and working on a country estate entail.",Residency – The Resonant Garden,"This call is open to artists living in the EU with both research- and studio-based practices who wish to engage with the garden as a metaphor, a method and/or a material environment. Applicants should embrace and value the rural location and the sense of quiet and relative isolation that living and working on a country estate entail.",28 Jun 2026,2026-06-28,2026-09-23 12:37:25.170322+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_6fb802635c01,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-ruimte-voor-je-artistieke-praktijk/,https://www.kuleuven.be/english/culture/bacartlab/opencall/opencall-2026-2027,BAC ART LAB / KU Leuven,"Beeldende kunstenaars, audiovisuele kunstenaars en designers kunnen gratis een atelierruimte in BAC ART LAB aanvragen. Ook podiumkunstenaars en performers kunnen in onze kunstenwerkplaats repeteren en hun werk tonen.","Beeldende kunstenaars, audiovisuele kunstenaars en designers; podiumkunstenaars en performers",open call,Belgium,Leuven,gratis een atelierruimte in BAC ART LAB,no fee,,"Beeldende kunstenaars, audiovisuele kunstenaars en designers kunnen gratis een atelierruimte in BAC ART LAB aanvragen. Ook podiumkunstenaars en performers kunnen in onze kunstenwerkplaats repeteren en hun werk tonen.","Beeldende kunstenaars, audiovisuele kunstenaars en designers; podiumkunstenaars en performers",open call,,Belgium,Leuven,"['Visual Arts', 'Performing Arts', 'Digital/New Media Arts', 'Design/Architecture']",['Open Call'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'free atelier space in BAC ART LAB'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754891+00:00,False,,,,en,Open call: space for your artistic practice,Studeer je of werk je volgend academiejaar aan Associatie KU Leuven (incl. LUCA School of Arts)? Ben je op zoek naar een ruimte voor je artistieke praktijk?,Open call: space for your artistic practice,Studeer je of werk je volgend academiejaar aan Associatie KU Leuven (incl. LUCA School of Arts)? Ben je op zoek naar een ruimte voor je artistieke praktijk?,22 Jun 2026,2026-06-22,2026-09-23 12:37:25.173622+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_ff06696af524,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/showcase-your-work-to-the-european-early-music-sector/,,Kunstenpunt,"This call is seeking four early music ensembles . During REMA, the selected artists will have the opportunity to give a short 25-minute concert in the Chamber Music Hall at Concertgebouw Brugge.",early music,open call,Flanders or Brussels,Brugge,"In addition to the concert, we are offering a fee of 250 euros and an expense allowance; advice and support before, during and after the Early Music Summit; access to the Early Music Summit.",,,"This call is seeking four early music ensembles . During REMA, the selected artists will have the opportunity to give a short 25-minute concert in the Chamber Music Hall at Concertgebouw Brugge.",early music,open call,,Flanders or Brussels,Brugge,['Music'],['Open Call'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 250.0, 'amount_max': 250.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'fee for the concert'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'expense allowance; advice and support before, during and after the Early Music Summit; access to the Early Music Summit'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754898+00:00,,,,,en,Showcase your work to the European early music sector,"This call is aimed at early music soloists and ensembles who are ready to further internationalise their activities. We are specifically targeting ensembles based in Flanders or Brussels that have not yet received structural funding , but which already have an active programme of productions and concerts.

The soloist or the ensemble plays early music; is active in Flanders and Brussels; is available on 25 or 26 November 2026; is not systematically supported under the Arts Decree.",Showcase your work to the European early music sector,"This call is aimed at early music soloists and ensembles who are ready to further internationalise their activities. We are specifically targeting ensembles based in Flanders or Brussels that have not yet received structural funding , but which already have an active programme of productions and concerts.

The soloist or the ensemble plays early music; is active in Flanders and Brussels; is available on 25 or 26 November 2026; is not systematically supported under the Arts Decree.",15 Jun 2026,2026-06-15,2026-09-23 12:37:25.176367+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_24c1762e9c89,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/design-the-worlds-first-permanent-public-memorial-dedicated-to-the-victims-of-the-climate-crisis/,https://www.climatejusticeforrosa.org/open-call,"Climate Justice for Rosa, Greenpeace, Amnesty International, Oxfam and the Climate Coalition","We are calling upon artists, architects, designers, scenographers, and creative collectives to contribute to the creation of a public memorial dedicated to the victims of the global climate crisis.","artists, architects, designers, scenographers, and creative collectives",Commission,Belgium,Brussels,"The estimated production budget we can currently foresee is around €25,000 . At this stage, approximately €20,000 has already been secured.",,,"We are calling upon artists, architects, designers, scenographers, and creative collectives to contribute to the creation of a public memorial dedicated to the victims of the global climate crisis.","artists, architects, designers, scenographers, and creative collectives",Commission,,Belgium,Brussels,"['Visual Arts', 'Design/Architecture', 'Multidisciplinary']",['Commission'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': 25000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'estimated production budget foreseen'}, {'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': 20000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'already secured; aggregate budget, not per-applicant support'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754933+00:00,,,,,en,Design the World’s First Permanent Public Memorial Dedicated to the Victims of the Climate Crisis,"We are currently looking for expressions of interest . At this preliminary stage, we require answers to the following questions: Are you interested in contributing to this project? Are you available to actively engage in the process over the coming weeks? Can you commit to delivering a first concept proposal by July 1st, 2026 ? Your first conceptual proposal may include: Sketches, conceptual notes, or baseline visualizations.",Design the World’s First Permanent Public Memorial Dedicated to the Victims of the Climate Crisis,"We are currently looking for expressions of interest . At this preliminary stage, we require answers to the following questions: Are you interested in contributing to this project? Are you available to actively engage in the process over the coming weeks? Can you commit to delivering a first concept proposal by July 1st, 2026 ? Your first conceptual proposal may include: Sketches, conceptual notes, or baseline visualizations.",15 Jun 2026,2026-06-15,2026-09-23 12:37:25.180501+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_73af767aad70,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/a-work-for-kanal-before-kanal-opens/,https://forms.gle/kBDDPC2bH5g9zB6z9,KANAL–Centre Pompidou,"In September 2026, before its public opening, KANAL–Centre Pompidou hosts Zero Horizon , a new iteration of Miniature by Alexander Schellow and David Weber-Krebs. The project takes place in a museum building in transition, between completion and public activation. We are looking for twelve participants for a process-based performative work combining workshops, rehearsals, and performative encounters.",performance,Open call,Belgium,Brussels,Participants will receive a fee based on an estimated average rate of €27 per hour of active performance time. Catering will be provided during workshop and rehearsal days.,,,"In September 2026, before its public opening, KANAL–Centre Pompidou hosts Zero Horizon , a new iteration of Miniature by Alexander Schellow and David Weber-Krebs. The project takes place in a museum building in transition, between completion and public activation. We are looking for twelve participants for a process-based performative work combining workshops, rehearsals, and performative encounters.",performance,Open call,,Belgium,Brussels,['Performing Arts'],['Open Call'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 27.0, 'amount_max': 27.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': None, 'note': 'average rate of active performance time'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'catering provided during workshop and rehearsal days'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.754975+00:00,,,,,en,A work for KANAL before KANAL opens,No prior professional experience in performance is required. Participants contribute to situated individual and speculative narratives embedded in the architectural and institutional context. A connection to the local context and openness to collaborative work are essential.,A work for KANAL before KANAL opens,No prior professional experience in performance is required. Participants contribute to situated individual and speculative narratives embedded in the architectural and institutional context. A connection to the local context and openness to collaborative work are essential.,14 Jun 2026,2026-06-14,2026-09-23 12:37:25.186918+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_9b6a847d32f1,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/pitch-your-idea-during-the-zminaresilience-x-benelux-networking-session/,https://platform.izolyatsia.org/en/events/zmina-benelux-2026/,"Creative Europe Desks of Flanders, Wallonia-Brussels, Luxembourg, and the Netherlands","On 24 June 2026, ZMINA:Resilience team, together with the Creative Europe Desks of Flanders, Wallonia-Brussels, Luxembourg, and the Netherlands, invites cultural and creative organisations from the Benelux region to a dedicated networking session. This event is designed for those looking to connect with Ukrainian cultural organisations and explore collaboration opportunities within the framework of Creative Europe’s special calls supporting Ukraine . Whether you have a project concept ready or are simply looking to discover what Ukrainian organisations are working on — this session offers a structured and results-oriented space to find future partners.",cultural and creative sectors,networking session,Benelux region,,"This call will allow organizations to apply for up to €25,000 to create new cultural productions between organizations from Ukraine and other Creative Europe countries (see past call for reference). Showcasing rolling call: Starting in June 2026, new calls for showcasing of existing artistic work will open every two months (following the Culture Moves Europe model) with up to €50,000 co-financing to present existing works and practices for new audiences.",,,"On 24 June 2026, ZMINA:Resilience team, together with the Creative Europe Desks of Flanders, Wallonia-Brussels, Luxembourg, and the Netherlands, invites cultural and creative organisations from the Benelux region to a dedicated networking session. This event is designed for those looking to connect with Ukrainian cultural organisations and explore collaboration opportunities within the framework of Creative Europe’s special calls supporting Ukraine . Whether you have a project concept ready or are simply looking to discover what Ukrainian organisations are working on — this session offers a structured and results-oriented space to find future partners.",cultural and creative sectors,networking session,,Benelux region,,['Multidisciplinary'],['Other'],[],"['Belgium', 'Netherlands', 'Luxembourg']","[{'category': 'Materials/Production Costs', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': 25000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'up to for new cultural productions'}, {'category': 'Exhibition/Presentation Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': 50000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'up to co-financing to present existing works and practices for new audiences'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.755005+00:00,,,,,en,Pitch your idea during the ZMINA:Resilience × Benelux Networking Session,"Organizational Focus: Grants are available to legal entities/organizations. Open Sectoral Approach: No strict sectoral restrictions; participation is open to all cultural and creative sectors with a focus on participatory and socially-engaged work. Limitation is the Audiovisual sector (MEDIA). Benelux Interest: Specifically tailored for organizations from Flanders, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Wallonia looking for high-impact international cooperation with Ukraine.",Pitch your idea during the ZMINA:Resilience × Benelux Networking Session,"Organizational Focus: Grants are available to legal entities/organizations. Open Sectoral Approach: No strict sectoral restrictions; participation is open to all cultural and creative sectors with a focus on participatory and socially-engaged work. Limitation is the Audiovisual sector (MEDIA). Benelux Interest: Specifically tailored for organizations from Flanders, Luxembourg, the Netherlands, and Wallonia looking for high-impact international cooperation with Ukraine.",14 Jun 2026,2026-06-14,2026-09-23 12:37:25.189822+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_ad6b7bb11552,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-apprentice-master-season-2026-2027/,https://kunstpodium-t.com/tips/open-call-apprentice-master-season-2026-2-2,Kunstpodium T,"Are you ready to develop your practice in our experimental project space? This within a vibrant network of fellow starting ánd renowned artists? Then mark june 5th 23:00 in your calendar, the deadline for our Apprentice Master program.",artists,Open call,Belgium,Tilburg,Participation is compensated with a decent exhibition fee.,,recently graduated artists,"Are you ready to develop your practice in our experimental project space? This within a vibrant network of fellow starting ánd renowned artists? Then mark june 5th 23:00 in your calendar, the deadline for our Apprentice Master program.",artists,Open call,recently graduated artists,Belgium,Tilburg,['Multidisciplinary'],['Open Call'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Exhibition/Presentation Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'decent exhibition fee; amount not stated'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.755065+00:00,,,,,en,Open call Apprentice/Master season 2026 – 2027,"This season we’ll select 28 recently graduated artists, they will be divided into 7 different groups. *It is possible to apply as an autodidact. Please send an e-mail to contact@kunstpodium-t.com . We will determine your eligibility for our program on a case-by-case basis.",Open call Apprentice/Master season 2026 – 2027,"This season we’ll select 28 recently graduated artists, they will be divided into 7 different groups. *It is possible to apply as an autodidact. Please send an e-mail to contact@kunstpodium-t.com . We will determine your eligibility for our program on a case-by-case basis.",05 Jun 2026,2026-06-05,2026-09-23 12:37:25.192574+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_4d016b2d08b2,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-perfomers-kostuum-en-modeontwerpers/,,kunsten.be,"Rumour has it that, after an extremely wonderful, but very much kept under the radar first edition, a second ‘Dress-up-tea-Party’ is being organised. This time, with some budget, and the courage to be more of a public event. Performers are invited to come and spill some tea, serve tea and infuse the tea room with their character.",performers; costume- & fashion designers,Open Call,Belgium,Brussels,Artist honorarium fee €100,,,"Rumour has it that, after an extremely wonderful, but very much kept under the radar first edition, a second ‘Dress-up-tea-Party’ is being organised. This time, with some budget, and the courage to be more of a public event. Performers are invited to come and spill some tea, serve tea and infuse the tea room with their character.",performers; costume- & fashion designers,Open Call,,Belgium,Brussels,"['Performing Arts', 'Design/Architecture']",['Open Call'],[],['Belgium'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 100.0, 'amount_max': 100.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'artist honorarium fee'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:13.755071+00:00,,,,,en,Open Call for performers and costume- & fashion designers,"We are inviting anyone to send us a proposal to create a performance, character or small happening around the (social) aspects of drinking tea (ceremonial, historical, colonial, its gossipy aspect etc) to be presented during our Dress-up-tea-Party.

For the ‘Dress-up’ part of our party, we welcome fashion- & costume designers to send a proposal of a selection of pieces/ costumes (from their oeuvre) to be used during the Dress-Up-Tea-Party. Your pieces will be actively worn by visitors/participants and will be handled with care.",Open Call for performers and costume- & fashion designers,"We are inviting anyone to send us a proposal to create a performance, character or small happening around the (social) aspects of drinking tea (ceremonial, historical, colonial, its gossipy aspect etc) to be presented during our Dress-up-tea-Party.

For the ‘Dress-up’ part of our party, we welcome fashion- & costume designers to send a proposal of a selection of pieces/ costumes (from their oeuvre) to be used during the Dress-Up-Tea-Party. Your pieces will be actively worn by visitors/participants and will be handled with care.",01 Jun 2026,2026-06-01,2026-09-23 12:37:25.196257+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_dbee5b009884,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-summerlab-met-dan-daw-bij-p-a-r-t-s/,,Platform K,"Ben je een ervaren performer met of zonder beperking en wil je je verdiepen in inclusieve danspraktijken met een sterke focus op reflectie? Platform K werd gevraagd om tijdens de jaarlijkse SummerSchool van P.A.R.T.S. een SummerLab te cureren rond inclusieve danspraktijk. Dit jaar nodigen we choreografen Dan Daw (VK/Australië) en Sarah Blanc (VK/Ierland) uit om deze week te begeleiden, die plaatsvindt van 13 tot 17 juli 2026 . Het SummerLab biedt de kans om kennis te maken met de werkwijze van Dan Daw Creative Projects (DDCP). Samen met choreografen Dan Daw (VK/Australië) en Sarah Blanc (VK/Ierland) ontwikkelen we choreografisch materiaal vertrekkend vanuit thema’s als individuele en collectieve veerkracht – ontleend aan DDCP’s nieuwste werk EXXY . Dit doen we door te improviseren, teksten te schrijven en gesprekken te voeren.",dans / performancekunst,Workshop,Belgium,Brussels,We werken met een pay what you can -systeem. De bijdrage voor de volledige week bedraagt: €250 (richtprijs) / €200 (verminderd tarief).,We werken met een pay what you can -systeem. De bijdrage voor de volledige week bedraagt: €250 (richtprijs) / €200 (verminderd tarief).,ervaren performer,"Ben je een ervaren performer met of zonder beperking en wil je je verdiepen in inclusieve danspraktijken met een sterke focus op reflectie? Platform K werd gevraagd om tijdens de jaarlijkse SummerSchool van P.A.R.T.S. een SummerLab te cureren rond inclusieve danspraktijk. Dit jaar nodigen we choreografen Dan Daw (VK/Australië) en Sarah Blanc (VK/Ierland) uit om deze week te begeleiden, die plaatsvindt van 13 tot 17 juli 2026 . Het SummerLab biedt de kans om kennis te maken met de werkwijze van Dan Daw Creative Projects (DDCP). Samen met choreografen Dan Daw (VK/Australië) en Sarah Blanc (VK/Ierland) ontwikkelen we choreografisch materiaal vertrekkend vanuit thema’s 