kunsten_be_flanders_75741deaac9b,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/goddessarts-prize-open-call/,https://www.goddessartsmag.com/goddessarts-prize,Goddessarts Magazine,"We are thrilled to announce our first art prize, celebrating the divine feminine in all her forms – from mythological figures to mothers, muses, spiritual archetypes, and women who inspire. This is your moment to channel your vision of what a goddess means to you! All mediums welcome – painting, sculpture, drawing, collage, photography, mixed media & digital art.","All mediums welcome – painting, sculpture, drawing, collage, photography, mixed media & digital art.",Art Prize Competition,international,,"1st Prize: 250 € Cash, Solo Virtual Exhibition, 6-page Magazine Feature, Interview, Winner’s Certificate",Early Bird – July 20 | Fee: 35 € Regular – August 31 | Fee: 45 €,artist of all stages of career and all ages,"We are thrilled to announce our first art prize, celebrating the divine feminine in all her forms – from mythological figures to mothers, muses, spiritual archetypes, and women who inspire. This is your moment to channel your vision of what a goddess means to you! All mediums welcome – painting, sculpture, drawing, collage, photography, mixed media & digital art.","All mediums welcome – painting, sculpture, drawing, collage, photography, mixed media & digital art.",Art Prize Competition,artist of all stages of career and all ages,international,,['Multidisciplinary'],['Competition/Prize'],['Any/Open to All'],['International/Global'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 250.0, 'amount_max': 250.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'cash prize; includes solo virtual exhibition, magazine feature, interview, and certificate'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:31.817899+00:00,True,35.0,45.0,EUR,en,Goddessarts Prize – Open Call,"Eligibility: international, artist of all stages of career and all ages",Goddessarts Prize – Open Call,"Eligibility: international, artist of all stages of career and all ages",31 Aug 2025,2025-08-31,2026-09-23 12:37:25.481413+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_437b564efaf9,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/residentie-bij-khmessen-noorwegen/,http://www.khmessen.no/,Kunstnarhuset Messen,"Applications are now open for a working period for 1- to 3 months in 2026 at International Art residency KHMessen in Norway! A beautiful residency that is located in the hart of the Hardanger, between the mountains and the fjord. The Art residence gives time for reflection, research, presentation and production.","visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists",Residency,Norway,Ålvik,,we ask a fee of 1000 Norwegian Krone per month (approx. 85 euro).,at any stage of their careers,"Applications are now open for a working period for 1- to 3 months in 2026 at International Art residency KHMessen in Norway! A beautiful residency that is located in the hart of the Hardanger, between the mountains and the fjord. The Art residence gives time for reflection, research, presentation and production.","visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists",Residency,at any stage of their careers,Norway,Ålvik,"['Visual Arts', 'Literature/Writing', 'Music', 'Performing Arts']",['Residency'],['Any/Open to All'],['Norway'],[],,True,1000.0,1000.0,NOK,en,Residency at KHMessen (Noorwegen),"We welcome visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists at any stage of their careers who are interested in exploring and expanding their work in a unique and supportive environment.",Residency at KHMessen (Noorwegen),"We welcome visual artists, writers, composer/musicians, performance artists at any stage of their careers who are interested in exploring and expanding their work in a unique and supportive environment.",31 Aug 2025,2025-08-31,2026-09-23 12:37:25.485019+00:00
kunsten_be_flanders_e7ad5b0af54f,kunsten_be_flanders,https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/open-call-voor-residentie-silence-awareness-existence-in-finland/,https://www.arteles.org,Arteles Creative Center,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced. Taking place at the heart of the Northern winter, the conditions are excellent for creative contemplation, solitary introspection, concentrating intensively on your work, thinking and being, as well as for sharing experiences and ideas with other, similarly oriented minds. There is no pressure to have a concrete productive outcome, in case your focus is more in inner development, self-reflection and research. All participation in group activities is voluntary.","artists, writers, researchers",Residency,Finland,,"Applicants who otherwise would be unable to join the program can apply for financial support. The number of financially supported residencies is limited. Regular fee: 1950 € / monthly period Financially supported fee (limited availability): 1350 € / monthly period Contributor’s fee (optional): 2610 € / monthly period All fees include the registration fee (120 € / person, non-refundable, to be paid only if/when becoming selected). All the residents have accommodation in a private bedroom.",There is no application fee.,,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced. Taking place at the heart of the Northern winter, the conditions are excellent for creative contemplation, solitary introspection, concentrating intensively on your work, thinking and being, as well as for sharing experiences and ideas with other, similarly oriented minds. There is no pressure to have a concrete productive outcome, in case your focus is more in inner development, self-reflection and research. All participation in group activities is voluntary.","artists, writers, researchers",Residency,,Finland,,"['Multidisciplinary', 'Literature/Writing']",['Residency'],[],['Finland'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1950.0, 'amount_max': 1950.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'regular fee; registration fee of 120 € per person is included'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1350.0, 'amount_max': 1350.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'financially supported fee; limited availability; registration fee of 120 € per person is included'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 2610.0, 'amount_max': 2610.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'contributor’s fee; optional; registration fee of 120 € per person is included'}, {'category': 'Fee Waiver', 'amount_min': 120.0, 'amount_max': 120.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'registration fee, non-refundable, included in all fees'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'private bedroom for all residents'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:31.817926+00:00,False,,,,en,Open Call for residency Silence Awareness Existence in Finland,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced.",Open Call for residency Silence Awareness Existence in Finland,"Thematic, transdisciplinary residency program in Finland for artists, writers, researchers and creative minds attuned to the theme. The program brings together creative individuals from different backgrounds. Artistic, scientific, meditative and existentialistic approaches are all equally embraced.",28 Aug 2025,2025-08-28,2026-09-23 12:37:25.488378+00:00
