u_jazdowski_warsaw_1ae39a067e01,u_jazdowski_warsaw,https://u-jazdowski.pl/en/programme/residencies/open-calls/open-call-international-fellowship-mensch-maschine-2026,https://www.kunststrom.com/mensch-maschine-2026-open-call.html,Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art,"Under the theme Mensch Maschine 2026 : Mechanic Ghosts and Entangled Realities , the programme will award four fully funded international artist fellowships ( each worth EUR 20 , 000 ) . The initiative supports projects at the intersection of art , energy , and ecology , exploring the relationship between humans and machines within social , political , and environmental contexts .",all disciplines,artist fellowships,,Warsaw,"four fully funded international artist fellowships ( each worth EUR 20 , 000 )",,,"Under the theme Mensch Maschine 2026 : Mechanic Ghosts and Entangled Realities , the programme will award four fully funded international artist fellowships ( each worth EUR 20 , 000 ) . The initiative supports projects at the intersection of art , energy , and ecology , exploring the relationship between humans and machines within social , political , and environmental contexts .",all disciplines,artist fellowships,,,Warsaw,['Multidisciplinary'],['Fellowship'],[],[],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 20000.0, 'amount_max': 20000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'each fellowship fully funded'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:45.634078+00:00,,,,,en,Open Call : International Fellowship Mensch Maschine 2026,"Artists from all disciplines are invited to apply , particularly those working with sound , performance , film , and literature / poetry .",Open Call : International Fellowship Mensch Maschine 2026,"Artists from all disciplines are invited to apply , particularly those working with sound , performance , film , and literature / poetry .",16 November 2025,2025-11-16,2026-09-23 12:37:34.099479+00:00
u_jazdowski_warsaw_12d96c6e05cf,u_jazdowski_warsaw,https://u-jazdowski.pl/en/programme/residencies/open-calls/rezydencje-kryzysowe-pazdziernik,,"Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art, Zachęta – National Gallery of Art and Centre of Polish Sculpture in Orońsko","Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art , Zachęta – National Gallery of Art and Centre of Polish Sculpture in Orońsko invite Ukrainian artists and other art professionals seeking refuge from the war to apply for residencies in Warsaw or Orońsko . Families are welcome .",artists and other art professionals,residencies,Poland,Warsaw or Orońsko,"— per diems — free access to the library and gallery , cinema and the other facilities of the host organization",,,"Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art , Zachęta – National Gallery of Art and Centre of Polish Sculpture in Orońsko invite Ukrainian artists and other art professionals seeking refuge from the war to apply for residencies in Warsaw or Orońsko . Families are welcome .",artists and other art professionals,residencies,,Poland,Warsaw or Orońsko,['Multidisciplinary'],['Residency'],[],['Poland'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'per diems'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'free access to library, gallery, cinema, and other host facilities'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:45.634132+00:00,,,,,en,Emergency residencies for Ukrainian artists,"This open call is dedicated to all Ukrainian artists who crossed the Ukrainian border after February 24 , 2022 , because of the war . In the title of the e - mail please indicate to which institution you are applying : Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art or Zachęta – National Gallery of Art Please send your submission in English or Ukrainian language to : emergency . residency@kultura . gov . pl",Emergency residencies for Ukrainian artists,"This open call is dedicated to all Ukrainian artists who crossed the Ukrainian border after February 24 , 2022 , because of the war . In the title of the e - mail please indicate to which institution you are applying : Ujazdowski Castle Centre for Contemporary Art or Zachęta – National Gallery of Art Please send your submission in English or Ukrainian language to : emergency . residency@kultura . gov . pl","11 September 2022 , 11 : 59 pm ( GMT+2 )",2022-09-11,2026-09-23 12:37:34.109896+00:00
