acc_galerie_weimar_1c586a1763b4,acc_galerie_weimar,https://acc-weimar.de/getmedia.php/_media/202510/121151v0-orig.pdf,,ACC Galerie Weimar and the City of Weimar,The International Studio Program is looking for compelling project proposals from visual artists from around the world that address these questions. We welcome experimental forms that embrace Weimar as a place of remembrance—in a good sense as in art and high culture as well as in the bad sense of experiences like the Nazi era. Under consideration are also the small stories of “everyday” life.,visual artists,International Studio Program,Germany,Weimar,Selected artists will receive a monthly stipend of 1.100€.,,,The International Studio Program is looking for compelling project proposals from visual artists from around the world that address these questions. We welcome experimental forms that embrace Weimar as a place of remembrance—in a good sense as in art and high culture as well as in the bad sense of experiences like the Nazi era. Under consideration are also the small stories of “everyday” life.,visual artists,International Studio Program,,Germany,Weimar,['Visual Arts'],['Residency'],[],['Germany'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1100.0, 'amount_max': 1100.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': None}]",2026-09-24 08:57:55.334465+00:00,,,,,en,All These Moments – The Future of Artistic Storytelling,The International Studio Program is looking for compelling project proposals from visual artists from around the world that address these questions. We welcome experimental forms that embrace Weimar as a place of remembrance—in a good sense as in art and high culture as well as in the bad sense of experiences like the Nazi era. Under consideration are also the small stories of “everyday” life.,All These Moments – The Future of Artistic Storytelling,The International Studio Program is looking for compelling project proposals from visual artists from around the world that address these questions. We welcome experimental forms that embrace Weimar as a place of remembrance—in a good sense as in art and high culture as well as in the bad sense of experiences like the Nazi era. Under consideration are also the small stories of “everyday” life.,,,2026-09-23 13:53:09.860060+00:00
arts_council_wales_1c3ee5bf8e2f,arts_council_wales,https://arts.wales/funding/individuals/edinburgh-bursary-2026,https://portal.arts.wales/,Arts Council of Wales,"Arts Council of Wales’ Edinburgh Bursary 2026 is a funding opportunity to participate in networking and Fringe Connect events and workshops at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe 2026, alongside seeing high quality UK and international work.",performing arts,funding opportunity,Wales,Edinburgh,"You can apply for a bursary of up to £1,700. This is to cover expenses such as transport, per diems, performance tickets and a contribution towards your time. Accommodation will be provided for you in addition to the bursary amount. For those working for and salaried by an organisation in receipt of Arts Council of Wales multi-year funding, you can apply for a bursary of up to £1,000 to cover expenses, such as transport, per diems and performance tickets. Accommodation will be provided as part of the bursary offer.",,,"Arts Council of Wales’ Edinburgh Bursary 2026 is a funding opportunity to participate in networking and Fringe Connect events and workshops at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe 2026, alongside seeing high quality UK and international work.",performing arts,funding opportunity,,Wales,Edinburgh,['Performing Arts'],['Grant/Funding'],[],['United Kingdom'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1000.0, 'amount_max': 1700.0, 'currency': 'GBP', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'bursary; higher amount applies to those salaried by an organisation in receipt of Arts Council of Wales multi-year funding'}, {'category': 'Travel Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'covers transport'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'covers per diems and performance tickets; contribution towards time'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'provided in addition to bursary / as part of offer'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:55.334482+00:00,,,,,en,Edinburgh Bursary 2026,"Individual artists and creative professionals working in the performing arts in Wales can apply. You will have a good track record in Wales in creating, producing or staging work and are now looking to explore new connections and opportunities across the UK and internationally. You will need to demonstrate how going to Edinburgh at this point will be beneficial to your future ambitions for touring and collaboration. Take a look at our eligibility criteria for individuals to see if you are eligible. You can apply if you are working for and salaried by an organisation in receipt of Arts Council of Wales multi-year funding. You will have no or limited experience of Edinburgh Festival Fringe but can demonstrate how the opportunity will be beneficial to your professional development and to your current role.",Edinburgh Bursary 2026,"Individual artists and creative professionals working in the performing arts in Wales can apply. You will have a good track record in Wales in creating, producing or staging work and are now looking to explore new connections and opportunities across the UK and internationally. You will need to demonstrate how going to Edinburgh at this point will be beneficial to your future ambitions for touring and collaboration. Take a look at our eligibility criteria for individuals to see if you are eligible. You can apply if you are working for and salaried by an organisation in receipt of Arts Council of Wales multi-year funding. You will have no or limited experience of Edinburgh Festival Fringe but can demonstrate how the opportunity will be beneficial to your professional development and to your current role.","1pm, 16th June 2026",2026-06-16,2026-09-23 13:53:09.922245+00:00
