arts_council_wales_32942d1388ee,arts_council_wales,https://arts.wales/funding/individuals/research-and-development-0,https://arts.wales/application-process,Arts Council of Wales,Research and Development supports the development and creation of high-quality and ambitious work. It supports exploring and developing new ideas and ways of working in collaboration with partners. Proposals should have a clear intention to create work that will reach audiences and demonstrate a strong potential for future success.,the artforms that we support,funding,Wales,,"There are two levels of award: small, up to £10,000 and large, up to £30,000.",,,Research and Development supports the development and creation of high-quality and ambitious work. It supports exploring and developing new ideas and ways of working in collaboration with partners. Proposals should have a clear intention to create work that will reach audiences and demonstrate a strong potential for future success.,the artforms that we support,funding,,Wales,,['Multidisciplinary'],['Grant/Funding'],[],['United Kingdom'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 10000.0, 'amount_max': 10000.0, 'currency': 'GBP', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'small award, up to'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 30000.0, 'amount_max': 30000.0, 'currency': 'GBP', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'large award, up to'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:55.334534+00:00,,,,,en,Research and Development,"Organisations and individuals can apply. Take a look at our eligibility criteria for organisations and our eligibility criteria for individuals to see if you are eligible. Please note - For individuals looking to develop their own practice rather than to develop work with intent to reach audiences, please see our Creative Practice fund .",Research and Development,"Organisations and individuals can apply. Take a look at our eligibility criteria for organisations and our eligibility criteria for individuals to see if you are eligible. Please note - For individuals looking to develop their own practice rather than to develop work with intent to reach audiences, please see our Creative Practice fund .",,,2026-09-23 13:53:09.926321+00:00
arts_council_wales_ccdc0a35b8b6,arts_council_wales,https://arts.wales/funding/international/international-opportunities-fund,https://portal.arts.wales/,Arts Council of Wales / Wales Arts International,Funding for the development and delivery of international work.,arts,funding,Wales,,"Up to £7,500 for: International Collaboration and International Partnership Development International Presentation of Work International Networks and Events Up to £5,000 for: International Residencies For international residencies taking place outside of Europe and in locations where travel and living costs might be higher, we may be able to accept an application requesting support up to a maximum of £7,500.",,,Funding for the development and delivery of international work.,arts,funding,,Wales,,['Multidisciplinary'],['Grant/Funding'],[],['United Kingdom'],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 5000.0, 'amount_max': 7500.0, 'currency': 'GBP', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'up to £5,000 for international residencies; up to £7,500 for international collaboration, partnership development, presentation, networks and events; may be up to £7,500 for residencies outside Europe with higher travel/living costs'}]",2026-09-24 08:57:55.334589+00:00,,,,,en,International Opportunities Fund,Arts organisations and individual creative professionals based in Wales.  Individuals and organisations based in Wales and working within the artforms we support .,International Opportunities Fund,Arts organisations and individual creative professionals based in Wales.  Individuals and organisations based in Wales and working within the artforms we support .,,,2026-09-23 13:53:09.926333+00:00
