can_serrat_c72d67f59662,can_serrat,https://canserrat.org/en-visual-art-residency-open-call-2027,https://forms.gle/p4w5bv4rCc71L8Zs5,Can Serrat,"Can Serrat is opening a new residency call for visual and multidisciplinary artists from all backgrounds and nationalities. The residencies will take place during summer and autumn 2027 in El Bruc, at the foot of Montserrat and 45 km from Barcelona.",visual and multidisciplinary art,residency,Spain,El Bruc,"Invitations: Full Grant for six weeks + artist fee Full Grant for one month 20 Partial Grants

Full Grant + artist fee:
● Accommodation at Can Serrat (private room for six weeks from 2nd of August 2027).
● Meals: 2 prepared community dinners per week, access to a list of basic food supplies (coffee, tea, condiments, and some dry goods depending on availability).
● Artist Fee 2000€, subject to the receipt of the totality public funding.

Full Grant:
● Accommodation at Can Serrat (shared room for one month in October 2027).
● Meals: 2 prepared community dinners per week, access to a list of basic food supplies (coffee, tea, condiments, and some dry goods depending on availability).

Partial Grants: Minimum residency duration: one month
● Option 1 Shared room: €1130/month (shared with up to 3 people)
● Option 2 Private room: €1745/month
● Option 3 Studio only (no accommodation or meals included): €305/month
*Options 1 and 2 include 2 prepared community dinners, access to a list of basic food items (coffee, tea, condiments, and some dry goods, depending on availability).

Production Grant — Visual Arts
Financial support of €3,000* intended to recognize one of the artistic processes developed during the residency and support its future production.

Retorns Grants — Visual Arts and Writing
Return grant to come back to Can Serrat for an additional one-month residency during the following year.",,,"Can Serrat is opening a new residency call for visual and multidisciplinary artists from all backgrounds and nationalities. The residencies will take place during summer and autumn 2027 in El Bruc, at the foot of Montserrat and 45 km from Barcelona.",visual and multidisciplinary art,residency,,Spain,El Bruc,"['Visual Arts', 'Multidisciplinary']",['Residency'],[],['Spain'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'private room for six weeks'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'meals: 2 prepared community dinners per week plus access to basic food supplies'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 2000.0, 'amount_max': 2000.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'one-time', 'note': 'artist fee, subject to receipt of total public funding'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'shared room for one month'}, {'category': 'Other/Unspecified Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'meals: 2 prepared community dinners per week plus access to basic food supplies'}, {'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'shared room up to 3 people or private room or studio only, depending on option'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1130.0, 'amount_max': 1130.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'partial grant option 1, shared room'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 1745.0, 'amount_max': 1745.0, 'currency': 'EUR', 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'partial grant option 2, private room'}, {'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': 305.0, 'amount_max': 305.0, 'currency':