institut_francais_programs_0e6d2766c96e,institut_francais_programs,https://www.institutfrancais.com/en/program/project-support/connect-create-strengthen-cultural-ties-between-Africa-and-Europe,https://forms.gle/3y5nvCNvHm5MEvNZ6,Institut français,"Connect & Create is the Sub-Saharan Africa component of the Africa–Europe Partnerships for Culture program, funded by the European Union.",Performing arts / Music,Project support,,,The mentees’ organizations will receive a grant to support their development and capacity building.,,young communications professionals,"Connect & Create is the Sub-Saharan Africa component of the Africa–Europe Partnerships for Culture program, funded by the European Union.",Performing arts / Music,Project support,young communications professionals,,,"['Performing Arts', 'Music']",['Grant/Funding'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],[],"[{'category': 'Grant/Stipend', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'support for development and capacity building'}]",2026-09-24 08:58:03.013976+00:00,,,,,en,Connect & Create – Strengthening Cultural Ties Between Africa and Europe,"Applicants must be over 18 years of age , be proficient in French or English, and reside in South Africa, Benin, Cameroon, Ghana, Guinea, Kenya, Mali, Mozambique, Uganda, the Republic of the Congo, Rwanda or Senegal. Particular attention will be paid to their experience, motivation, local roots and audience reach.",Connect & Create – Strengthening Cultural Ties Between Africa and Europe,"Applicants must be over 18 years of age , be proficient in French or English, and reside in South Africa, Benin, Cameroon, Ghana, Guinea, Kenya, Mali, Mozambique, Uganda, the Republic of the Congo, Rwanda or Senegal. Particular attention will be paid to their experience, motivation, local roots and audience reach.",13 October 2026,2026-10-13,2026-09-23 13:53:40.020899+00:00
institut_francais_programs_6c1cd2a3a743,institut_francais_programs,https://www.institutfrancais.com/en/programme/project-support/debating-ideas,https://espace-reseau.institutfrancais.com/fr/offre/debat-idees,Institut français,"The Débat d'idées call for projects is dedicated to the cooperation and cultural action network's projects in the field of the diplomacy of ideas and knowledge, through the organization of a ""Night of Ideas"", on the date desired by the post, and an annual cycle of debates, articulated to the diplomatic post's strategy of influence.",ideas and knowledge,call for projects,,,,,,"The Débat d'idées call for projects is dedicated to the cooperation and cultural action network's projects in the field of the diplomacy of ideas and knowledge, through the organization of a ""Night of Ideas"", on the date desired by the post, and an annual cycle of debates, articulated to the diplomatic post's strategy of influence.",ideas and knowledge,call for projects,,,,['Other/Non-Arts'],['Open Call'],[],[],[],,,,,,en,Debating ideas,"Seuls les Instituts français, les Instituts français de recherche à l’étranger et les Alliances françaises peuvent déposer un projet dans le cadre de cet appel, les SCAC n’étant pas habilités à recevoir une aide versée par l’Institut français.",Debating ideas,"Seuls les Instituts français, les Instituts français de recherche à l’étranger et les Alliances françaises peuvent déposer un projet dans le cadre de cet appel, les SCAC n’étant pas habilités à recevoir une aide versée par l’Institut français.",30 October 2026,2026-10-30,2026-09-23 13:53:40.024716+00:00
institut_francais_programs_b4f40b7f5fa2,institut_francais_programs,https://www.institutfrancais.com/en/programme/residence-and-professional-mobility/residencies-institut-francais-x-cite-internationale,https://ifprog.emundus.fr/fr/campagne-info?view=programme&cid=343,Institut français x Cité internationale des arts,"The Institut français x Cité internationale des arts residency program is open to artists and cultural professionals who have been residing outside of France for at least 5 years and who wish to develop a research and creative project in Paris during a three-, six-, or nine-month residency.",Architecture Visual Arts / Photography Cinema Digital creation Book Crafts / Design Performing arts / Music,residency,France,Paris,The Institut français de Paris covers the monthly costs associated with the individual studio apartments at the Cité internationale des arts.,,,"The Institut français x Cité internationale des arts residency program is open to artists and cultural professionals who have been residing outside of France for at least 5 years and who wish to develop a research and creative project in Paris during a three-, six-, or nine-month residency.",Architecture Visual Arts / Photography Cinema Digital creation Book Crafts / Design Performing arts / Music,residency,,France,Paris,"['Design/Architecture', 'Photography', 'Film/Video', 'Craft', 'Performing Arts', 'Music']",['Residency'],[],['France'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': 'per month', 'note': 'monthly studio apartment costs at Cité internationale des arts covered by Institut français de Paris'}]",2026-09-24 08:58:03.013991+00:00,,,,,en,Residencies: Institut français x Cité internationale des arts,"Be supported by one or more associated partners
