gasworks_london_356ae5fa0c20,gasworks_london,https://www.gasworks.org.uk/opportunities/upe-foundation-curatorial-fellow,https://www.gasworks.org.uk/2026/08/13/Upe_Curatorial_Fellow-Gasworks_Application_Form_2026_v3.docx,Upė Foundation and Gasworks,"The Upė Foundation Curatorial Fellowship is an 12-18 month full-time paid position embedded within Gasworks’ curatorial team. Conceived as a professional development opportunity for an early-career curator with a connection to the Baltic region, the Fellowship offers sustained experience across Gasworks’ exhibitions, residencies, public programmes and wider artistic activity.",curatorial,fellowship,United Kingdom,London,"a fully funded artist residency in London, followed by a solo exhibition at Gasworks in 2028.",,early-career,"The Upė Foundation Curatorial Fellowship is an 12-18 month full-time paid position embedded within Gasworks’ curatorial team. Conceived as a professional development opportunity for an early-career curator with a connection to the Baltic region, the Fellowship offers sustained experience across Gasworks’ exhibitions, residencies, public programmes and wider artistic activity.",curatorial,fellowship,early-career,United Kingdom,London,['Curating/Art Criticism'],['Fellowship'],['Emerging/Early-Career'],['United Kingdom'],"[{'category': 'Accommodation/Housing', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'fully funded artist residency in London'}, {'category': 'Exhibition/Presentation Support', 'amount_min': None, 'amount_max': None, 'currency': None, 'period': None, 'note': 'solo exhibition at Gasworks in 2028'}]",2026-09-24 09:59:19.148782+00:00,,,,,en,Upė Foundation Curatorial Fellow,Conceived as a professional development opportunity for an early-career curator with a connection to the Baltic region,Upė Foundation Curatorial Fellow,Conceived as a professional development opportunity for an early-career curator with a connection to the Baltic region,"9 November